[489.311125, "o", "2026/07/03 14:53:02 HOOK LOADED\r\n2026/07/03 14:53:02 Server started at http://0.0.0.0:8090\r\n├─ REST API:  http://0.0.0.0:8090/api/\r\n└─ Dashboard: http://0.0.0.0:8090/_/\r\n\r\n(!) Launch the URL below in the browser if it hasn't been open already to create your first superuser account:\r\nhttp://0.0.0.0:8090/_/#/pbinstal/REDACTED\r\n(you can also create your first superuser by running: /home/user/myproject/pocketbase superuser upsert EMAIL PASS)\r\n\r\n2026/07/03 14:53:04 HOOK ip: 127.0.0.1 now: 1783090384945\r\n2026/07/03 14:53:05 HOOK ip: 127.0.0.1 now: 1783090385101\r\n2026/07/03 14:53:05 HOOK ip: 127.0.0.1 now: 1783090385226\r\n2026/07/03 14:53:05 HOOK ip: 127.0.0.1 now: 1783090385355\r\n"]
